收一个像卢克这样的学生是他们走运
They'd be lucky to have a kid like Luke.

178
00:06:33,840 --> 00:06:35,301
应该坏不到哪里去
Well, I guess it -- it can't hurt.

179
00:06:35,380 --> 00:06:37,320
他们又不能"超级"拒收
I mean, it's not like they can super reject him.

180
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:39,900
虽然密歇根大学的确用了这词
Although, Michigan did use that exact term.

181
00:06:42,044 --> 00:06:43,970
这里是96.3潮流台  我们是迪亚哥与傻驴
You're on Caliente 96.3 with Diego and The Donkey.

182
00:06:43,980 --> 00:06:45,240
你好  太棒了
Hello! Yes!

183
00:06:45,640 --> 00:06:47,820
我打来是想获得格洛丽亚·埃斯特凡的票
I'm calling about the Gloria Estefan tickets.

184
00:06:47,900 --> 00:06:49,738
只要你能接上下面的歌词  票就归你了
And they're all yours if you can complete this lyric --

185
00:06:49,920 --> 00:06:51,160
扭转"啥啥"
"Turn the blank around."

186
00:06:52,100 --> 00:06:53,800
她在90年代最火的歌之一
One of her biggest hits from the '90s.

187
00:06:53,940 --> 00:06:55,060
我们今早一直在放
We've been playing it all morning.

188
00:06:55,320 --> 00:06:57,200
-"扭转车..."  -不对  还有两次机会
- "Turn the car around." - Nope. Two more guesses.

189
00:06:57,700 --> 00:06:58,300
"扭转船"
"Turn the boat around."

190
00:06:58,840 --> 00:06:59,820
再试一次
Try again.

191
00:07:00,080 --> 00:07:01,480
"扭转经济"
"Turn the economy around"!

192
00:07:02,720 --> 00:07:04,100
你个蠢驴
You're an ass.

193
00:07:04,805 --> 00:07:05,684
靠
Damn it!

194
00:07:08,040 --> 00:07:09,620
我被密歇根大学"超级录取"了
I just got super accepted to Michigan.

195
00:07:09,780 --> 00:07:12,160
他是迪尔加多家族第二个上大学的人
He's the second Delgado to go to college.

196
00:07:12,160 --> 00:07:15,500
我表哥进了哥伦比亚最好的医学院
My cousin went to the best medical school in Colombia.

197
00:07:15,940 --> 00:07:17,860
那里可不是什么尸体都收的
They would not just accept any cadaver.

198
00:07:18,080 --> 00:07:18,900
行了  妈  我们走
Okay, Mom, let's go.

199
00:07:19,040 --> 00:07:19,721
好  不过先等下
Oh, yeah, but wait.

200
00:07:19,800 --> 00:07:22,640
还记得你脑袋这么小的时候吗
You remember when your head was this tiny?

201
00:07:23,060 --> 00:07:24,960
行了  妈  我不缺帽子
Okay. Mom, Mom, I think I'm set for hats.

202
00:07:25,580 --> 00:07:27,500
女人想大哭时  我看得出来
I know when a female's about to burst into tears.

203
00:07:27,720 --> 00:07:29,020
我看过够多次了
I've seen it enough times.

204
00:07:29,520 --> 00:07:30,620
我得让我妈远离
I had to keep my mom away

205
00:07:30,620 --> 00:07:32,700
任何会让她想到我要离开的东西
from anything that reminded her I was moving away

206
00:07:32,720 --> 00:07:34,820
也让我自己远离厨房用品店
and keep myself away from Williams Sonoma.

207
00:07:35,120 --> 00:07:36,260
我可能会耗掉整个下午在里面
I could lose an afternoon.

208
00:07:37,780 --> 00:07:39,440
宠物店  又萌又有趣
A pet store. These are fun.

209
00:07:39,740 --> 00:07:41,120
我觉得它想妈妈了
I think he misses his mommy.

210
00:07:41,404 --> 00:07:43,840
我们走到车边时它估计就忘掉妈妈吗
He'll forget about her by the time we get to the car.

211
00:07:44,200 --> 00:07:45,600
再一想  我们去看电影吧
On second thought, let's catch a movie.

212
00:07:45,780 --> 00:07:47,660
电影总能让人忘了烦恼
They always help keep your mind off of things.

213
00:07:51,200 --> 00:07:52,500
等等  警官  不要
Wait, Officer -- No!

214
00:07:52,500 --> 00:07:54,540
我的车停在这里是因为我是负责任的人
My car is only here because I was being responsible!

215
00:07:54,720 --> 00:07:55,900
我负责照看我舅乔
I was babysitting my uncle Joe

216
00:07:55,900 --> 00:07:57,380
结果喝得太醉不能开车回家了
and got too drunk to drive home!

217
00:07:59,580 --> 00:08:01,100
这是什么鬼东西
What is this thing?!

218
00:08:01,360 --> 00:08:02,140
挡风玻璃锁
The Barnacle.

219
00:08:02,500 --> 00:08:05,100
没交停车罚单  警察就把它贴你车上
They stick it on your car when you have unpaid parking tickets.

220
00:08:05,300 --> 00:08:06,700
我不能让爸妈看到
I couldn't let my parents see it,

221
00:08:06,700 --> 00:08:07,940
因为我知道他们会小题大做
because I knew they'd just overreact

222
00:08:07,940 --> 00:08:09,220
给我讲一堆要负责的大道理
and lecture me about being irresponsible,

223
00:08:09,740 --> 00:08:11,280
我也不能付罚单移除这东西
and I couldn't pay to remove it

224
00:08:11,280 --> 00:08:12,640
因为我刚刷爆了信用卡
because I just maxed out my credit card

225
00:08:12,640 --> 00:08:14,560
买了副超贵的太阳镜
on these insanely expensive pair of sunglasses.

226
00:08:15,460 --> 00:08:16,455
我也不想
I don't love 'em.

227
00:08:19,620 --> 00:08:22,970
我只要重新画一张莉莉的猪莉莉画
I just had to re-create Lily's painting of Pig Lily,

228
00:08:22,980 --> 00:08:24,601
她就不会知道那件事
and she'd be none the wiser.

229
00:08:24,900 --> 00:08:27,520
天  就像用香肠画画似的
Oh, it's like painting with sausages.

230
00:08:28,860 --> 00:08:31,020
抱歉  小卡  这里没有莉莉画的小猪画
Sorry, Cam, no pig painting by Lily here.

231
00:08:31,220 --> 00:08:33,260
不过有一些涂鸦
I do have some random scribbles

232
00:08:33,260 --> 00:08:34,400
是卢克还小的时候画...
that Luke made when he was...

233
00:08:35,460 --> 00:08:36,781
好像是比我希望的岁数还大些时画的
Huh, that's a little later than I'd hoped.

234
00:08:37,440 --> 00:08:39,120
好  这事绝不能告诉米奇尔
Fine. Not a word of this to Mitchell.

235
00:08:39,580 --> 00:08:40,680
我知道你好奇原因
I'm sure you're curious why.

236
00:08:40,980 --> 00:08:41,880
你又错了
Wrong again.

237
00:08:45,318 --> 00:08:45,961
你是第一个到的
Hi. You're the first one here.

238
00:08:46,020 --> 00:08:47,600
别担心  我们不必闲聊的
Don't worry. We don't have to make conversation.

239
00:08:47,920 --> 00:08:48,700
剪贴簿
Ooh! A scrapbook!

240
00:08:49,732 --> 00:08:50,621
瞧瞧
Aww, look at this.

241
00:08:50,760 --> 00:08:51,760
我们小时候的学校作业都在
All of our old school projects --

242
00:08:52,860 --> 00:08:54,360
我和克莱尔画的画
paintings by me and Claire.

243
00:08:55,332 --> 00:08:56,658
你就是个豆腐心啊
Aww! You're just a big softie, aren't 'cha?

244
00:08:56,840 --> 00:08:58,740
我律师的秘书整的
My lawyer's secretary put that together

245
00:08:58,740 --> 00:09:00,400
为了提升我在离婚法庭上的形象
for my image at the divorce trial.

246
00:09:00,600 --> 00:09:02,260
还是原来强硬的熊爸
There's the old bear. Grr!

247
00:09:02,540 --> 00:09:04,210
这是我八岁生日时照的
Oh, this is from my 8th birthday.

248
00:09:04,220 --> 00:09:06,940
我让妈给我办了场农场主题的派对
I made Mom throw a party with a whole farm theme.

249
00:09:07,480 --> 00:09:08,440
猜怎么著  我需要这张照片
You know what? I need this.

250
00:09:08,760 --> 00:09:10,280
小卡觉得我看不起他的农场生活
Cam thinks I look down on his farm life.

251
00:09:10,695 --> 00:09:11,270
-这能证明给他看...  -停停停
- This'll prove to him that... - Bup, bup, bup.

252
00:09:11,280 --> 00:09:12,461
要照片得付出代价
This comes with a price.

253
00:09:12,680 --> 00:09:14,380
你能给我弄到格洛丽亚·埃斯特凡的票吧
You can get me Gloria Estefan tickets, right?

254
00:09:14,620 --> 00:09:15,820
爸  这话有点冒犯人
Dad, that is offensive.

255
00:09:15,920 --> 00:09:17,972
不是所有同性恋都跟她有交情
Not every gay person is connected to Gloria Estefan.

256
00:09:18,600 --> 00:09:19,460
但你有  对吧
But you are, right?

257
00:09:19,860 --> 00:09:20,920
情况很复杂
It's complicated.

258
00:09:21,460 --> 00:09:22,780
小卡曾和格洛丽亚·埃斯特凡的
Cam briefly dated a member

259
00:09:22,983 --> 00:09:25,061
迈阿密之音乐队的一员约过会
of Gloria Estefan's band, The Miami Sound Machine.

260
00:09:25,320 --> 00:09:26,720
他不常提起
He doesn't talk about it much.

261
00:09:26,880 --> 00:09:29,480
也就有人提到她或迈阿密就说吧
Just whenever someone mentions her or Miami.

262
00:09:30,320 --> 00:09:30,616
还有湿度
Or humidity.

263
00:09:31,740 --> 00:09:32,100
就这样
Well...

264
00:09:33,120 --> 00:09:34,680
一手给票  一手给照片
when I get the tickets, you get the picture.

265
00:09:35,540 --> 00:09:35,900
小气
Mean!

266
00:09:38,200 --> 00:09:40,480
你愿不愿意请小卡动用他的关系
Um, how would you feel about asking Cam to use his connections

267
00:09:40,635 --> 00:09:42,470
弄到两张今晚看格洛丽亚·埃斯特凡的票
to get two Gloria Estefan tickets for tonight

268
00:09:42,491 --> 00:09:43,820
然后偷偷给我
and then secretly giving them to me?

269
00:09:43,960 --> 00:09:44,720
我愿意做
I'll do it,

270
00:09:44,760 --> 00:09:46,960
但你要先帮我办车的事
but I need you to help me with my car first.

271
00:09:47,200 --> 00:09:48,540
我可以找我爸妈  但...
I'd ask my parents, but --

272
00:09:48,540 --> 00:09:50,100
他们不会理解  这不是你的错
They wouldn't understand. It's not your fault.

273
00:09:50,100 --> 00:09:50,920
行  我们快去
Yeah. Okay. Let's go.

274
00:09:52,140 --> 00:09:54,200
你确定这是最好的办法吗
Are we sure this is the best way to do this?

275
00:09:54,440 --> 00:09:57,400
我们只需要确保我爸妈不会看到它
All we have to do is make sure that my parents don't see it

276
00:09:57,400 --> 00:09:58,140
我们往前开点就行了
by moving it down the street.

277
00:09:58,358 --> 00:09:59,721
-懂吗  抓好  -我就是你的眼
- Okay? Hold on. - I'm your eyes.

278
00:10:00,080 --> 00:10:00,560
沿著路边
Hug the curb.

279
00:10:01,040 --> 00:10:02,320
海莉...  好吧  直著开
Haley, just -- all right. Straighten out.

280
00:10:02,835 --> 00:10:03,481
开启危险警告灯
T-Turn on your hazards.

281
00:10:04,941 --> 00:10:06,521
-那是雨刷  -你踩到我腿了  挪开
- That's the windshield wiper! - You're on my leg! Move!

282
00:10:06,720 --> 00:10:08,080
天啊  有棵树...
Oh, God! There's a tree.

283
00:10:09,340 --> 00:10:09,920
好吧
All right.

284
00:10:09,920 --> 00:10:12,000
我们先喘口气  等一下
Let's just breathe, let's take a moment...

285
00:10:12,220 --> 00:10:13,340
你能从我腿上挪开吗
Can you just get off my leg, please?

286
00:10:13,360 --> 00:10:14,810
对不...  我没有...
I'm not -- I'm s-- I'm not --

287
00:10:14,820 --> 00:10:16,401
-我们在往后吗  -你挂了倒车档
- Are we going backwards? - You put us in reverse.

288
00:10:16,480 --> 00:10:17,320
踩刹车
Okay, hit the brake.

289
00:10:17,680 --> 00:10:18,940
那是油门
That is the gas!

290
00:10:19,180 --> 00:10:20,800
你驾照是怎么考的啊
How do you have a license?!

291
00:10:20,820 --> 00:10:22,660
我动不了  你压到我腿了
I can't move! You're on my leg!

292
00:10:24,740 --> 00:10:26,700
好了  第一次尝试还不错
Okay. Good first try.

293
00:10:28,260 --> 00:10:31,080
不敢相信你不来杯斗牛犬冰沙
Can't believe you didn't treat yourself to a Bulldog Blast.

294
00:10:31,300 --> 00:10:32,920
那不就是糖  冰
Isn't that basically just sugar, ice,

295
00:10:32,940 --> 00:10:34,920
还有用来涂蓝人乐队的蓝油漆吗
and the stuff they you use to cover the Blue Man Group?

296
00:10:36,020 --> 00:10:37,380
我们来见招生办主任
We're here to see the Dean of Admissions.

297
00:10:37,411 --> 00:10:38,902
我们来过电话  邓菲家
We called. We're the Dunphys.

298
00:10:39,060 --> 00:10:40,440
我会告诉欣登主任你们到了
Ah. I'll tell Dean Hinden you're here.

299
00:10:40,700 --> 00:10:41,801
欣登吗
Um, eh -- Hinden?

300
00:10:42,140 --> 00:10:43,481
是的  鲁道夫·欣登主任
Yes. Dean Rudolf Hinden.

301
00:10:45,240 --> 00:10:46,380
我有不好的感觉
I have a bad feeling.

302
00:10:46,840 --> 00:10:48,920
亲爱的  你的确刚喝了那像防冻剂的饮料
Well, honey, you did just have two of those antifreezes.

303
00:10:49,240 --> 00:10:49,680
不是啦
No.

304
00:10:50,180 --> 00:10:51,880
鲁迪·欣登  我们曾是同学
Rudy Hinden -- We were classmates.

305
00:10:52,540 --> 00:10:54,520
超烦人  总是很亢奋
Super annoying -- always "on."

306
00:10:54,540 --> 00:10:57,040
我们都是拉拉队的  一起玩蹦床
We cheered together, we -- we tumbled together,

307
00:10:57,160 --> 00:10:58,320
一起四处玩
we rolled around together,

308
00:10:58,320 --> 00:10:59,540
但我们关系从不亲密
but we were never close.

309
00:10:59,900 --> 00:11:02,420
我说斗牛  你说犬
When I say "Bull," you say "Dog"!

310
00:11:02,620 --> 00:11:03,460
-斗牛  -犬
- Bull! - Dog!

311
00:11:03,580 --> 00:11:04,560
-斗牛  -犬
- Bull! - Dog!

312
00:11:04,660 --> 00:11:05,240
你好  鲁迪
Hey, Rudy!

313
00:11:05,340 --> 00:11:06,960
这位是我太太克莱尔
This is my wife Claire.

314
00:11:07,200 --> 00:11:08,100
-你好  -很荣幸
- Hi. - Pleasure.

315
00:11:08,220 --> 00:11:09,160
很高兴认识你
Nice to meet you.

316
00:11:10,540 --> 00:11:11,641
快请进吧
Well, please come on in.

317
00:11:11,800 --> 00:11:14,260
-蹦床不错啊  -谢谢
- Oh! Great trampoline. - Thanks.

318
00:11:14,420 --> 00:11:16,700
我习惯每天跳至少20分钟
I like to bounce at least 20 minutes a day.

319
00:11:16,740 --> 00:11:17,861
-我的好点子都是在蹦跳中产生的  -好吧
- It's where I get my best ideas. - Okay.

320
00:11:18,240 --> 00:11:18,820
真是个怪人啊
How quirky.

321
00:11:19,380 --> 00:11:20,580
对了  菲尔
Oh, hey, Phil,

322
00:11:21,040 --> 00:11:22,980
当年的高年级比赛在哪里举行
where were Nationals senior year?

323
00:11:23,043 --> 00:11:24,230
克利夫兰  俄"嗨"俄州
Cleveland, Oh-- Hi-o!

324
00:11:24,240 --> 00:11:25,980
你能想象忍受这种怪胎
Can you imagine putting up with this

325
00:11:25,980 --> 00:11:27,660
-很多年的心情吗  -的确很难
- for years on end? - It's hard.

326
00:11:28,240 --> 00:11:29,660
这样吧  我去跳一会找灵感
Tell you what, I'll give it some bounce time

327
00:11:29,660 --> 00:11:31,220
回头给你答复
and hit you back with an answer.

328
00:11:31,360 --> 00:11:32,780
你好像挺忙的
Listen, you seem busy.

329
00:11:32,820 --> 00:11:33,680
那我就直说了
I'll get straight to it.

330
00:11:33,700 --> 00:11:36,100
我们儿子卢克申请了这里  但没被录取
Our son Luke applied and didn't get in,

331
00:11:36,100 --> 00:11:37,400
我觉得你可以再考虑一下
and I think it's worth reconsidering.

332
00:11:38,160 --> 00:11:40,120
他是个好孩子  只是大器晚成
He's a great kid. He's just a late bloomer.

333
00:11:40,460 --> 00:11:42,520
好的  我应该能帮你儿子搞定这事
Okay. I think we can make something happen for your boy.

334
00:11:43,620 --> 00:11:44,060
真的吗
Really?

335
00:11:44,280 --> 00:11:46,400
是啊  比他更糟糕的学生我们也录取过了
Yeah, we've let in way worse applicants than him.

336
00:11:47,520 --> 00:11:48,312
-鲁迪  -什...
- Rudy! - Wha--

337
00:11:48,332 --> 00:11:50,340
-太谢谢了  你最木奉棒了  -是啊
- Thank you! You're the B-E-S-T best! - Yeah.

338
00:11:50,660 --> 00:11:52,200
不客气
No problemo.

339
00:11:52,200 --> 00:11:55,180
我只要...
I'll just, uh...

340
00:11:55,180 --> 00:11:55,620
对了
Hey.

341
00:11:56,220 --> 00:11:57,600
既然你都来了
While you're here,

342
00:11:57,840 --> 00:11:59,560
有件事我一直想问你
I've always wanted to ask you something.

343
00:11:59,600 --> 00:12:01,260
你还记得以前你常表演的那个魔术吗
You remember that magic trick you used to do

344
00:12:01,260 --> 00:12:03,480
就是你蒙著眼从紧身服里挣脱出来那个
where you got out of a straitjacket blindfolded?

345
00:12:03,640 --> 00:12:04,220
巴纳姆骗局
Barnum's Humbug.

346
00:12:04,460 --> 00:12:05,800
对  就是那个
Yeah. That one.

347
00:12:06,700 --> 00:12:07,440
你是怎么做到的
How'd you do it?

348
00:12:07,940 --> 00:12:09,510
用魔法  我觉得应该...
Magic. I-I feel like --

349
00:12:09,520 --> 00:12:10,181
不不不  说真的
No, no, no, really --

350
00:12:10,360 --> 00:12:12,220
我已经试图破解这个魔术好几年了
I've been trying to figure it out for years.

351
00:12:12,360 --> 00:12:13,101
很抱歉
Um, I'm sorry.

352
00:12:13,180 --> 00:12:14,495
按照惯例
