00:18:07,340 --> 00:18:08,580
其他不要我的学校也没有做错
and neither did the other schools.

539
00:18:08,900 --> 00:18:09,500
我不会去上的
I'm not going.

540
00:18:09,680 --> 00:18:11,040
宝贝  这是你最后的机会了
Honey, it's your last chance.

541
00:18:11,612 --> 00:18:12,561
那我就明年再去上
Then I'll wait until next year.

542
00:18:12,720 --> 00:18:15,300
-要去  就得是正大光明进去  -这话我服
- If I go, I want to deserve it. - I can respect that.

543
00:18:15,440 --> 00:18:17,620
没人让你提供意见  谢谢
Nobody asked for your opinion, thank you.

544
00:18:17,720 --> 00:18:18,260
你必须得去上
You're going.

545
00:18:18,400 --> 00:18:19,860
你完全不知道你爸爸费了多大功夫
You have no idea what your father went through

546
00:18:19,860 --> 00:18:20,880
才为你弄到这机会
to get you this opportunity.

547
00:18:21,020 --> 00:18:23,420
以你无法想象到的方式牺牲自己人格
He debased himself in ways you can't imagine.

548
00:18:23,940 --> 00:18:25,820
你不是说没多严重吗
You said it wasn't that bad.

549
00:18:26,400 --> 00:18:27,020
你在看什么
What are you watching?

550
00:18:27,480 --> 00:18:28,580
我们的邻居发给我个视频
Our neighbor sent me a video.

551
00:18:28,920 --> 00:18:29,800
是海莉跟米奇尔
It's of Haley and Mitchell.

552
00:18:30,020 --> 00:18:32,020
不是  那是...  不需要放出...
Oh. No, that's -- okay, we don't need to...

553
00:18:32,454 --> 00:18:32,945
太久了吧
It's taking forever.

554
00:18:32,955 --> 00:18:35,099
我已经用全身力气推了
I'm pushing as hard as I can.

555
00:18:35,109 --> 00:18:37,080
你的挡风玻璃被人安上那东西了吗
You have one of those things on your windshield?

556
00:18:37,140 --> 00:18:39,100
你收到了多少张停车罚单啊
How many parking tickets do you have?

557
00:18:39,260 --> 00:18:41,160
我觉得现在焦点不应该在我啊
I think we're focused on the wrong thing here.

558
00:18:41,400 --> 00:18:42,760
卢克不去上大学了呢
Luke's not going to college.

559
00:18:42,900 --> 00:18:44,040
你的手指为什么是粉色的
Why is your finger pink?

560
00:18:45,140 --> 00:18:46,220
这不是我画的
This isn't mine.

561
00:18:46,240 --> 00:18:47,680
我就觉得作图视角怪怪的
I knew the perspective was off.

562
00:18:47,820 --> 00:18:48,700
是小卡的错
It's Cam's fault.

563
00:18:48,720 --> 00:18:49,980
他让我看著照片做出来的
He made me copy it from a photo.

564
00:18:50,400 --> 00:18:52,620
是这样的  我不小心毁了原件
You know what? I accidentally destroyed the original,

565
00:18:52,620 --> 00:18:53,660
我心里又过意不去
and I couldn't live without it.

566
00:18:53,700 --> 00:18:55,321
米奇尔·普里契特  我代表"育儿杂志"提问
Mitchell Pritchett, Parenting Magazine.

567
00:18:56,060 --> 00:18:58,280
伪造孩子的画就有比用派太太亡夫骨灰
How is forging a child's painting any less egregious

568
00:18:58,300 --> 00:19:01,660
来替换猪的骨灰强到哪里去吗
than replacing a pig's ashes with Mrs. Pasternak's dead husband?

569
00:19:01,680 --> 00:19:02,220
没有
It's not.

570
00:19:02,580 --> 00:19:04,480
我就是个伪君子  我的一生充满谎言
I'm a hypocrite. My whole life is a lie.

571
00:19:04,700 --> 00:19:06,560
卡洛斯并不是迈阿密之音的团员
Carlos isn't really in the Miami Sound Machine.

572
00:19:06,620 --> 00:19:08,520
他只是个...  普通的狗狗美容师
He's just a -- a basic dog groomer.

573
00:19:08,600 --> 00:19:10,120
把钱省下来吧  我不能帮你弄到票
Save your money. I couldn't get you your tickets.

574
00:19:10,400 --> 00:19:11,660
你花钱去买票
You're spending money on tickets

575
00:19:11,681 --> 00:19:12,871
而不是花钱去付掉罚票[单]吗...
when you should be spending money on ticket --

576
00:19:13,240 --> 00:19:14,320
你懂我的意思
you know what I mean.

577
00:19:14,400 --> 00:19:15,820
演唱会的票是帮米奇尔弄的
The concert tickets were for Mitchell.

578
00:19:16,220 --> 00:19:17,600
-所以你没帮我搞来门票吗  -没有
- So you didn't get my tickets? - No.

579
00:19:17,940 --> 00:19:20,500
-你没帮我买到票啊  -那网站像神经病
- So you didn't get my tickets. - The website was insane.

580
00:19:20,746 --> 00:19:22,050
没有猫鼬般的反应速度根本抢不到
You'd need the reflexes of a mongoose.

581
00:19:22,060 --> 00:19:23,541
你骗了我
You lied to me.

582
00:19:23,560 --> 00:19:25,581
看看大家  谁都在说谎
Well, look around! Everybody's lying.

583
00:19:25,720 --> 00:19:27,080
伪造画作  盲眼开车
Forging paintings, driving blind,

584
00:19:27,520 --> 00:19:28,200
偷换骨灰
swapping ashes.

585
00:19:28,280 --> 00:19:30,320
我不想毁了你的猪月嘛
I didn't want to ruin the Pig Moon.

586
00:19:30,500 --> 00:19:32,200
没有什么猪月好吗
There is no Pig Moon.

587
00:19:32,460 --> 00:19:34,680
你是觉得我密苏里老家有多落后啊
How backwards do you think Grasshopper, Missouri is?

588
00:19:37,539 --> 00:19:39,568
大家听我说  我能解决
Guys, guys. I've got this.

589
00:19:39,660 --> 00:19:40,180
各位
Guys.

590
00:19:40,180 --> 00:19:41,380
我打给塔格法官了
I talked to Judge Tager.

591
00:19:41,780 --> 00:19:43,440
他同意撤销你的罚单
He'll make your parking tickets disappear

592
00:19:43,440 --> 00:19:45,700
代价是给他来俩上好古巴雪茄
in return for a couple of Cubans.

593
00:19:45,940 --> 00:19:46,880
你拿了三根
You took three.

594
00:19:47,180 --> 00:19:49,440
另一根是给俱乐部的保安
The other one is for the security guard at the club.

595
00:19:50,000 --> 00:19:51,660
他今晚在埃斯特凡的演唱会兼职保安
He moonlights where Estefan's playing tonight.

596
00:19:51,660 --> 00:19:53,840
你们到时候入口见
He'll meet you by the stage door.

597
00:19:54,240 --> 00:19:56,120
谢谢你帮杰圆了谎
Thank you for fixing Jay's lies.

598
00:19:56,320 --> 00:19:58,400
我们都对说出实话感到棘手
We all struggle with the truth.

599
00:19:58,500 --> 00:20:00,860
就像上周四我帮你把杰拖在俱乐部
like last Thursday when I stalled Jay at the club

600
00:20:00,880 --> 00:20:02,680
好让你有时间把乔弄出狗门
so you could get Joe out of the doggy door.

601
00:20:02,840 --> 00:20:05,680
她不小心把我俩锁门外了  而瓦斯炉又没关
She locked us out, and the stove was on.

602
00:20:05,840 --> 00:20:08,380
-至于你们两个  -你有认识人能帮忙吗
- And you two. - You know a guy at a club that can help us?

603
00:20:08,580 --> 00:20:10,320
没有  你们多谈谈就行了
No. Just talk more.

604
00:20:10,640 --> 00:20:12,200
你们9成的问题
90% of your problems would be solved

605
00:20:12,200 --> 00:20:13,460
都只需要多谈谈就能解决
if you just discussed things.

606
00:20:13,940 --> 00:20:14,747
家里的范德考夫沙发是山寨货
The Vanderkoff is a knock-off.

607
00:20:15,300 --> 00:20:16,128
我不小心把山寨货烫出了个洞
I burnt a hole in the knock-off,

608
00:20:16,500 --> 00:20:17,861
所以买了个新的真品替换
and I had replaced it with a real one.

609
00:20:17,960 --> 00:20:19,500
好了  所有问题都解决了
Okay, everything's settled here.

610
00:20:19,620 --> 00:20:21,780
我觉得牛排好了  我们去吃饭吧
I think the steaks are ready. Let's go eat.

611
00:20:23,340 --> 00:20:24,620
看来我们的儿子
Well, I guess our son

612
00:20:24,620 --> 00:20:25,980
今年是不会去上大学了
isn't going to college this year.

613
00:20:26,280 --> 00:20:28,560
是啊  而我们本来应该很担心他
I know, and I know we're supposed to be worried about him.

614
00:20:28,560 --> 00:20:31,180
但你看到他刚才做的了吗
But do you see what he just did,

615
00:20:31,180 --> 00:20:33,280
他怎么帮大家解决问题
how he solved everybody's problems like that?

616
00:20:34,160 --> 00:20:35,900
还挺厉害的吧
It's pretty incredible, right?

617
00:20:36,040 --> 00:20:37,620
他是个邓菲家的好男儿啊  克莱尔
That's a Dunphy man, Claire --

618
00:20:37,800 --> 00:20:38,800
足智多谋  临危不乱
resourceful, cool,

619
00:20:38,800 --> 00:20:40,840
以及恰到好处的随机应变力
and just the right amount of savoir faire.

620
00:20:43,040 --> 00:20:44,581
我...  我们厨房见
I'll, uh -- I'll see you in the kitchen.

621
00:20:46,380 --> 00:20:48,700
所以这是真的范德考夫沙发啊
So this is a real Vanderkoff.

622
00:20:48,720 --> 00:20:51,860
对啊  从这秘密中解放出来太爽了
Yeah, yeah. Feels good to finally be free of that secret.

623
00:20:51,920 --> 00:20:54,400
对啊  把事情都摊开来说感觉太好了
Yeah, it's just... great to have everything out in the open.

624
00:20:54,840 --> 00:20:55,180
是啊
Yeah.

625
00:20:56,580 --> 00:20:58,160
那边你买来送我的名贵油画
That expensive painting you bought me over there,

626
00:20:58,181 --> 00:20:59,960
我移动他是为了挡墙上我弄出来的洞
I moved it to cover up a hope I made in the wall.

627
00:21:00,080 --> 00:21:02,320
我是在人家二手拍卖的时候花2毛5买的
I only paid 25 cents for that painting at a garage sale.

628
00:21:02,380 --> 00:21:03,680
剩下的钱我拿去买鞋了
I used the rest of the money on shoes

629
00:21:03,760 --> 00:21:05,780
我有做电流除毛  不然我胡子会长到这
I get electrolysis. My beard grows up to here.

630
00:21:05,860 --> 00:21:07,080
我其实不会跳排舞
I don't really know how to line dance,

631
00:21:07,100 --> 00:21:08,550
所以你做我教你的东西时
and that's why those cowboys laught at you

632
00:21:08,560 --> 00:21:09,681
那些牛仔都在笑你
when you did what I taught you.

633
00:21:11,420 --> 00:21:12,341
-那不是拉里  -那不是拉里
- That's not Larry - That's not Larry.
